#
# Image profiles for examples/buildspec.yml (PROFILE build env var).
# Format: NAME|INSTALLS|ASSETS|ASSET_VENV   (INSTALLS tuple: venv:model:env[:install.sh flags, comma-separated])
#   INSTALLS   space-separated venv:model:env tuples (upstream requirements/install.sh)
#   ASSETS     download_assets list (comma-separated; empty = none)
#   ASSET_VENV venv that runs download_assets (must be in INSTALLS, have mani_skill + hf)
# `full` is not listed: it is upstream's embodied-maniskill_libero target (13 venvs),
# the default, and the only profile that pushes :latest.
# Profiles whose venvs run ManiSkill use --env maniskill_libero and download maniskill,openpi
# assets (ManiSkill/SAPIEN PhysX + the openpi tokenizer), matching the validated full image.
# LIBERO-only profiles (libero-pi0, dreamzero) use --env libero (no ManiSkill/SAPIEN, ~1.5 GB
# smaller; upstream's documented install for DreamZero SFT + LIBERO eval). libero-pi0 downloads the
# openpi tokenizer; dreamzero needs no image assets (umt5-xxl tokenizer is staged on FSx).
examples|openvla-oft:openvla-oft:maniskill_libero openpi:openpi:maniskill_libero dreamzero:dreamzero:maniskill_libero|maniskill,openpi|openvla-oft
maniskill-oft|openvla-oft:openvla-oft:maniskill_libero|maniskill,openpi|openvla-oft
libero-pi0|openpi:openpi:libero|openpi|openpi
dreamzero|dreamzero:dreamzero:libero||
# pi0-FAST GRPO (LIBERO-10, 2x p5en): upstream's validated runtime is Python 3.12.12 + torch 2.11.0,
# no flash-attn (docs/.../embodied/pi0_fast.rst); the 4th tuple field passes those install.sh flags.
pi0-fast|pi0_fast:pi0_fast:libero:--python,3.12.12,--torch,2.11.0,--no-flash-attn||
# IsaacLab (Isaac Sim 5.1 needs RT-core GPUs: g7e/g6e/g5; not H100/H200). ISAAC_LAB_PATH=/opt/envs/isaaclab.
# Build with ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=5.1.0 ACCEPT_ISAAC_SIM_EULA=Y (Isaac Sim baked into /opt/isaacsim; opt-in,
# accepts the NVIDIA license). buildspec defaults FLASH_ATTN_ARCHS="8.0;9.0;10.0;12.0" (Blackwell) for this
# profile. The SFT checkpoint is on FSx.
isaaclab-gr00t|gr00t:gr00t:isaaclab||
